  <TitleLocalizationKey>k__BackingField: tutorial.harpoon.title
  <BodyLocalizationKey>k__BackingField: tutorial.harpoon.body
  <Title>k__BackingField: Harpoon
  <Body>k__BackingField: "Use the Harpoon to catch sea creatures while diving.\n\nHold Right Mouse Button to aim, then press Left Mouse Button to fire. A successful hit hooks the creature and starts a catch challenge.\n\nFollow the on-screen prompts and press Left Mouse Button at the right moments to pull the creature closer. Complete the challenge before time runs out to secure your catch.\n\nHold Right Mouse Button during the challenge if you want to cancel the attempt."
  <VideoClip>k__BackingField: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 26d7cc39b08a54744821a0c143ffa294, type: 3}
